From 1c5595384aab16d4438f854662ed280e5d1e5169 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 14:22:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 879/913] pta: scmi: remove a duplicated parameter check
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

cmd_process_msg_channel already rejects NULL input and output buffers
when checking the parameter types, so the same test repeated in the
SCP-firmware branch can never be true.

Coverity issue: CID 1200411: Logically dead code in cmd_process_msg_channel

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git b57a4e054b4ff2cdb7a4f1b5e919ec4fcef8f853 pta: scmi: remove a duplicated parameter check]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Opus-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I4400cea71d2b2d56891011eb5f2784b5b771465b
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/597000
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/pta/scmi.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/pta/scmi.c b/core/pta/scmi.c
index 2db3b89e2..ec553cca3 100644
--- a/core/pta/scmi.c
+++ b/core/pta/scmi.c
@@ -164,9 +164,6 @@ static TEE_Result cmd_process_msg_channel(uint32_t ptypes,
 	}
 
 	if (IS_ENABLED(CFG_SCMI_SCPFW)) {
-		if (!in_buf || !out_buf)
-			return TEE_ERROR_BAD_PARAMETERS;
-
 		res = scmi_server_msg_process_thread(channel_id, in_buf,
 						     in_size, out_buf,
 						     &out_size);
-- 
